  "changelog": "**Major update with modular architecture, expanded resource management, and improved security model.**\n\n- Introduced a fully modular structure: each function in its own file for easier maintenance and extension.\n- Extensive new resource management: covers pools, node pools, training jobs, inference services (v1 & v2), notebooks, SWR, VPC, KMS, and LiteServer.\n- Security enhancements: credentials are never exposed; in-memory handling only, strict masking and isolation.\n- Environment variable-based authentication: seamless in both notebook and local environments.\n- Added OBS as primary notebook storage with built-in OBS bucket management features.\n- New features include plugin and node configuration template management, comprehensive batch operations, and detailed reference documentation per resource.",
